hi-ogawa/vite-plugins#1243 (by hi-ogawa): [fullstack] rework API for dev server css? (simplified API for no css code split)
I think current approach has fundamental limitation in terms of API.

We may give up current uniform API. Instead, we could simply provide another API for simplified use case where code-splitting by each route is not important:

```js
function renderHtml() {
  // collect all css in server module graph at this point
  const css = await import("virtual:dev-server-css");
}
```
